  "note": "Sentence: when an option Data is indicated by its Length to extend beyond the Information field, the entire packet is silently discarded without affecting the automaton. (a) Replying: TestRFC1661LCPTruncatedOptionSilentlyDiscarded goes red on rec.count() != 0 for three layouts. (b) Moving the automaton: the same test starts in ReqSent and AckSent and asserts currentState() == start, then that a valid request is still Acked. TestRFC1661TruncatedOptionSilentlyDiscarded (IPCP, IPv6CP), the reply-direction units and TestRFC1661ClientRequestPastEndSilentlyDiscarded extend it. Negative: a contained unacceptable option still draws a Nak.",
